        "accordion_1": {
          "type": "accordion",
          "settings": {
            "badge": "01",
            "title": "Usage categories",
            "open_default": true,
            "content": "<p><strong>Commercial Grade Product Warranty:</strong> Intended for gyms, health clubs, and fitness centers where equipment is designed for up to <strong>8–12 hours of use per day</strong> with a high volume of users.</p><p><strong>Light Commercial Product Warranty:</strong> Intended for schools, police & fire stations, hospitals, rehab centers, and hotels where average usage runs 2–4 hours per day. Coverage is void if these products are used in full commercial environments.</p><p><strong>Home Use Product Warranty:</strong> Tailored for personal or home settings with usage under one hour per day. Coverage is void if used in light-commercial or commercial settings.</p>"
          }
        },
        "accordion_2": {
          "type": "accordion",
          "settings": {
            "badge": "02",
            "title": "How to redeem",
            "open_default": false,
            "content": "<ol><li><strong>Contact us</strong> to initiate the warranty claim process. Send us relevant photos or videos of the damage. We will then evaluate the best solution to address your concerns.</li><li><strong>Confirmation:</strong> Our support team will confirm that we have received your queries within 24 hours, and will respond with the course of action shortly afterwards.</li><li><strong>Assessment & Instructions:</strong> We will assess the necessary repairs and provide the required parts and detailed instructions. If the machine is no longer covered by the labor warranty, we will guide you through the installation or repair process. Alternatively, upon request, we can recommend qualified technicians in your area to handle the labor.</li><li><strong>Technician Dispatch:</strong> If your machine is covered by labor warranty, a technician will be dispatched shortly after the customer sends us the details of the service request, including any additional info requested by Fitness Superstore.</li><li><strong>Service Regions:</strong><br><strong>Northern California:</strong> Warranty service will be performed by our in-house technicians.<br><strong>Outside Northern California:</strong> Warranty service will be performed by a trusted member of our nationwide network of technicians.</li></ol><p><strong>Note 1:</strong> The warranty will be void if the customer fails to show up for a scheduled service call, unless they pay the technician directly. A trip charge will apply once the technician is dispatched.</p><p><strong>Note 2:</strong> If we send parts under the warranty, we will cover all shipping charges for warrantied parts. The customer also agrees to return any unused, defective, or old parts using the provided return shipping label.</p>"
          }
        },
        "accordion_3": {
          "type": "accordion",
          "settings": {
            "badge": "03",
            "title": "Inclusions",
            "open_default": false,
            "content": "<p><strong>The warranty covers the following:</strong></p><ul><li>This warranty covers any mechanical or electronic issues that prevent the machine from functioning like new.</li><li>Full coverage for all parts replacement, including structural moving parts such as bearings, pulleys, cables, motors, and batteries, if they cause the machine to malfunction.</li><li>Coverage for wearable parts heart rate monitors, pedals, treadmill decks, running belts, track wheels, and similar components, if they cause the machine to malfunction.</li><li>Lifetime Frame Warranty: The structural components including the Frame and Welds most French Fitness equipment are covered for life.</li><li>Coverage for software issues such as error screen messages, program malfunctions, and console resets.</li><li>Within the USA and Canada, 100% labor costs coverage, including unlimited on-site technician diagnostic and repair visits.</li></ul>"
          }
        },
        "accordion_4": {
          "type": "accordion",
          "settings": {
            "badge": "04",
            "title": "Exclusions",
            "open_default": false,
            "content": "<p><strong>The warranty does not cover the following:</strong></p><ol ><li><strong>Improper Use and Physical Damage:</strong> Mechanical, software, and cosmetic issues resulting from improper use, physical damage, or actions contrary to the operational manual. Damage caused by disassembling or reassembling the machine.</li><li><strong>Cosmetic Defects:</strong> Scratches, broken plastic, peeling stickers/logos/overlays, discoloration, and similar cosmetic issues, unless present upon receipt. If cosmetic defects are present upon arrival, contact us within one week of delivery.</li><li><strong>Missing Parts:</strong> If a missing part is reported within 7 days of delivery, it will be covered under warranty and shipped at no additional cost. After this period, the cost of reordering and replacement of missing parts will be the responsibility of the buyer.</li><li><strong>Environmental Damage:</strong> Damage from water, fire, heat, wind, or other elements, such as leaving the machine outdoors. Outdoor exposure accelerates wear and deterioration. Garage settings may be covered by the warranty.</li><li><strong>Total Loss:</strong> The warranty is void if the product or major parts are reported as stolen, missing, or lost.</li><li><strong>Unauthorized Purchases:</strong> The warranty does not extend to products not purchased from the French Fitness website or an authorized French Fitness reseller.</li><li><strong>Accident and Misuse:</strong> Damage resulting from accidents, misuse, or abuse. Damage caused by parts not manufactured or sold by us. Damage from product modifications. Damage from service by anyone other than us or an authorized warranty service provider. Damage from failure to provide necessary care as outlined in the owner's manual.</li><li><strong>Defaced Serial Number:</strong> The warranty does not cover products with removed, altered, or defaced serial numbers.</li><li><strong>Service Calls and Customer Instruction:</strong> The warranty does not cover service calls for operating instructions, installation, setup, or adjustments.</li><li><strong>Ineligible Warranty Service:</strong> If a product submitted for warranty service is found ineligible, an estimate of repair cost will be provided.</li></ol>"
          }
        },
        "accordion_5": {
          "type": "accordion",
          "settings": {
            "badge": "05",
            "title": "Additional Warranty Costs",
            "open_default": false,
            "content": "<p><strong>Additional warranty costs will be incurred when:</strong></p><ol><li>Canceling a service appointment after the service provider is already en route to your location or failing to cancel at all.</li><li>Misplacing parts or causing delays for the service provider due to customer-related issues.</li><li>Not being present or unable to provide access to the equipment when the service provider arrives, resulting in idle time.</li><li>Providing incorrect address information, leading to reshipment of parts.</li><li>Losing parts or failing to return requested parts.</li></ol><p><strong>French Fitness reserves the right to charge additional fees to the customer for any of the above reasons.</strong></p>"
          }
