        "accordion_6": {
          "type": "accordion",
          "settings": {
            "badge": "06",
            "title": "International Warranty Terms",
            "open_default": false,
            "content": "<ol><li>Outside the USA and Canada, the warranty covers all parts for <strong>3 years from the date of purchase</strong>.</li><li><strong>Labor is not included in this warranty.</strong></li><li>Gym accessories and free weights come with a <strong>30-day warranty</strong>. If an item becomes non-functional due to breakage, we will replace it free of charge. Please note that cosmetic defects (such as chunks of rubber missing), gashes, and other wear and tear are not covered unless reported within 7 days of receipt of the items.</li><li><strong>Cosmetic defects are covered for the first 7 days upon receipt of the items.</strong></li><li>We provide phone and email support with technicians who can assist you in diagnosing issues and guiding you through the installation of replacement parts.</li><li>If we send parts under the warranty, we will cover all shipping charges for warrantied parts. The customer also agrees to return any unused, defective, or old parts using the provided return shipping label. Failure to return parts replaced will void the warranty.</li></ol>"
          }
