        "accordion_8": {
          "type": "accordion",
          "settings": {
            "badge": "08",
            "title": "Need help?",
            "open_default": false,
            "content": "<p>For all warranty claims or parts requests:</p><p><strong>Email:</strong> <a href='mailto:support@frenchfitness.com'>support@frenchfitness.com</a></p><p><strong>Phone:</strong> <a href='tel:+19254306111'>(925) 430-6111</a> — Mon–Fri, 8 a.m.–4 p.m. PST</p><p>Our support team is on hand Monday through Friday, 8 a.m. to 4 p.m. PST, to help keep your equipment performing its best.</p><p>Labor, dispatch, and scheduling are fulfilled through independent service providers coordinated by National Gym Service, our designated warranty-dispatch partner. French Fitness covers all approved warranty parts and labor costs, ensuring consistent nationwide coverage and timely support without affecting customer rights.</p>"
