        "hero_pill_text": "U.S. Assembly + Lifetime Promise",
        "hero_eyebrow": "French Fitness",
        "hero_title": "French Fitness Warranty & Quality Promise",
        "hero_intro": "<p>You shouldn't need an expensive gym membership or a luxury budget to train on serious equipment. French Fitness makes high-quality, commercial-grade gear accessible at prices that don't break the bank— turning any space into a place you actually want to train, with stable, safe equipment that inspires confidence every time you use it.</p>",
        "hero_priorities_intro": "<p>That confidence starts with how we build. <a href=\"/collections/french-fitness\" title=\"French Fitness\">French Fitness equipment</a> is engineered around three core priorities:</p>",
        "hero_closing": "<p>Our product development team tests materials, drawing on years of commercial remanufacturing experience, and oversees U.S. assembly so everything feels stable, smooth, and consistent whenever you reach for it.</p>",
        "cosmetic_note": "Please note that cosmetic defects (such as chunks of rubber missing), gashes and other wear and tear are not covered unless reported within 7 days of receipt of items.",
        "origin_title": "Built on U.S. Assembly & Remanufacturing Expertise",
        "origin_content": "<p>Before creating French Fitness, Fitness Superstore spent years remanufacturing elite gym equipment from brands like Precor, Life Fitness, and Technogym. Tearing down and rebuilding these machines gave our team real insight into what holds up in the toughest environments.</p><p>That expertise now drives the design of brand-new, U.S.-assembled French Fitness equipment. Every frame, component choice, and engineering decision reflects lessons learned from rebuilding the industry's best—resulting in stronger designs, smarter construction, and machines <a href=\"/pages/why-choose-us\" title=\"Why choose us\">built to perform for years</a>.</p>",
        "standbehind_title": "How We Stand Behind Your Equipment",
        "standbehind_intro": "<p>When you choose French Fitness, you're not just buying gear—you're buying confidence. For most French Fitness strength and cardio equipment, your standard coverage in the USA & Canada includes:</p>",
        "standbehind_note": "Cosmetic issues for all French Fitness products are covered if reported within 7 days of delivery.",
        "cta_text": "Build Your Gym With Lifetime Protection →",
